       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EMPLOYEE-PAY.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 HOURS-WORKED PIC 9(3).
       01 HOURLY-RATE PIC 9(4)V99.
       01 GROSS-PAY PIC 9(7)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "Enter hours worked: " WITH NO ADVANCING.
           ACCEPT HOURS-WORKED.
           DISPLAY "Enter hourly rate: " WITH NO ADVANCING.
           ACCEPT HOURLY-RATE.
           MULTIPLY HOURS-WORKED BY HOURLY-RATE GIVING GROSS-PAY.
           DISPLAY "Gross pay: " GROSS-PAY.
           STOP RUN.
